# game/data/travel_events/wolves.rpy:3
translate ja travel_event_wolves_d9365df9:

    # "While trekking my way through the forests, I heard the distinct sound of...{i}howling?{/i}"
    "森を進んでいるうちに、はっきりと聞こえてきたのは…{i}遠吠えか？{/i}"

# game/data/travel_events/wolves.rpy:4
translate ja travel_event_wolves_9123a2e4:

    # "From the tree lines, a pack of hungry wolves descended upon me, snarling and circling."
    "樹々の間から、飢えた狼の群れが襲いかかり、唸り声をあげて私を取り囲んだ。"

# game/data/travel_events/wolves.rpy:7
translate ja travel_event_wolves_b05c7a7b:

    # "The wolves whined and howled as they scattered the winds."
    "狼たちは風を散らしながら、呻き、遠吠えして。"

# game/data/travel_events/wolves.rpy:8
translate ja travel_event_wolves_cda900f2:

    # MC "(Damn beasts!)"
    MC "(くそったれの化け物ども!)"

# game/data/travel_events/wolves.rpy:16
translate ja travel_event_wolves_f567ab41:

    # "With the last of the wolves yelping out in anguished pain, I quickly put the thing out of its misery."
    "最後の一匹の狼が苦痛の鳴き声をあげると、私は素早くその獣の苦しみを終わらせた。"

# game/data/travel_events/wolves.rpy:17
translate ja travel_event_wolves_a4f1e169:

    # MC "{i}*Sigh*{/i}"
    MC "{i}*はあ*{/i}"

# game/data/travel_events/wolves.rpy:18
translate ja travel_event_wolves_ed59b7aa:

    # MC "(These poor things are half-starved, no wonder they're attacking on sight...)"
    MC "(かわいそうに、半分飢えているんだ。見つけ次第襲ってくるのも無理はない…)"

# game/data/travel_events/wolves.rpy:22
translate ja travel_event_wolves_04301006:

    # MC @ think "I don't suppose {i}you{/i} could handle this?"
    MC @ think "{i}あんた{/i}に任せようなんて思わないけど？"

# game/data/travel_events/wolves.rpy:23
translate ja travel_event_wolves_c3f644c4:

    # ELENA "I mean, {i}I could try.{/i}"
    ELENA "まあ、{i}やってみようか{/i}"

# game/data/travel_events/wolves.rpy:25
translate ja travel_event_wolves_b6bd6149:

    # "Elena stepped forward and snarled towards the wolves, who tilted their heads curiously in understanding."
    "エレナが一歩踏み出し、狼たちに向かって低く唸ると、彼らは理解したように不思議そうに首をかしげた。"

# game/data/travel_events/wolves.rpy:26
translate ja travel_event_wolves_632809bd:

    # "After some brief barking, Elena turns towards you."
    "短い鳴き声の後、エレナはあなたの方に向き直る。"

# game/data/travel_events/wolves.rpy:27
translate ja travel_event_wolves_6b567ed4:

    # ELENA @ sad "They're starving... They only want some food, and they'll leave us alone."
    ELENA @ sad "空腹で苦しんでいる…食べ物さえ与えれば、放っておいてくれるんだ。"

# game/data/travel_events/wolves.rpy:35
translate ja travel_event_wolves_5484d21a:

    # "Tossing the meat towards them, the wolves happily whined and barked as they chowed down."
    "肉を投げてやると、狼たちは嬉しそうにクンクン、キャンキャン鳴きながらむしゃむしゃと食べ始めた。"

# game/data/travel_events/wolves.rpy:36
translate ja travel_event_wolves_a23af468:

    # "Satisfied with their meal, they sped off into the forests, their leader looking back to give one last bark of appreciation."
    "満足げに食事を終えると、彼らは森へと消えていった。リーダーは振り返り、感謝の一声をあげるところで物語は閉じられる。"

# game/data/travel_events/wolves.rpy:38
translate ja travel_event_wolves_058c8ebb:

    # ELENA @ smile "Looks like you've made a few new friends..."
    ELENA @ smile "新しく何人か友達ができたみたいね…"

# game/data/travel_events/wolves.rpy:41
translate ja travel_event_wolves_937daf18:

    # "The wolves sadly whined... but then, once more, they began to snarl and bear their fangs."
    "狼たちは哀しげな鳴き声をあげた…けれど、再び牙をむき出して唸り始めた。"

# game/data/travel_events/wolves.rpy:42
translate ja travel_event_wolves_3b747ef8:

    # ELENA "I don't think they're taking no for an answer!"
    ELENA "断るつもりはないみたい!"

# game/data/travel_events/wolves.rpy:48
translate ja travel_event_wolves_f567ab41_1:

    # "With the last of the wolves yelping out in anguished pain, I quickly put the thing out of its misery."
    "最後の狼が苦痛の悲鳴をあげると、私は素早くとどめを刺した。"

# game/data/travel_events/wolves.rpy:49
translate ja travel_event_wolves_a4f1e169_1:

    # MC "{i}*Sigh*{/i}"
    MC "{i}*はあ*{/i}"

# game/data/travel_events/wolves.rpy:50
translate ja travel_event_wolves_579541dd:

    # MC "(Well, that could have gone better.)"
    MC "(まあ、もっとうまくいったかもしれないな。)"

